# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository and checked out however
# the platform wants them. Without this, a Windows checkout rewrites every file
# to CRLF, Prettier — which expects LF — then reports the whole tree as
# unformatted, and running the formatter starts a fight with git that neither
# side wins.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, and must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.tog5backup binary
